  "bodyHash": "12d0b536baba829e",
  "content": "\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>Additional Redstone</strong></span></h2>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center;font-size:24px\">為紅石機制增添更多內容&nbsp;</h5>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/v31Shw5/divider-red.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">此模組支援 Forge 與 Fabric。請前往「檔案」標籤頁查看所有模組版本。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Fabric 版本需要 Fabric-API </span> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在此取得</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/v31Shw5/divider-red.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">目前已新增的邏輯閘：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/dfmw4qS/basic-gates.png\" alt=\"邏輯閘\" width=\"579\" height=\"450\"> </span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"> <span style=\"font-size:15pt\">其他方塊：</span> </span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/rFM76WB/sequencer.gif\" alt=\"序列器\" width=\"250\" height=\"188\"> &nbsp; <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/GtWWc3F/oscillator.gif\" alt=\"振盪器\" width=\"250\" height=\"188\">&nbsp; <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/fXJ8cbD/t-flip-flop.gif\" alt=\"T 翻轉觸發器\" width=\"250\" height=\"188\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/WHvSx50/toggle-latch.gif\" alt=\"切換鎖存器\" width=\"250\" height=\"188\">&nbsp; <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/vzjMCQc/timer.gif\" alt=\"計時器\" width=\"250\" height=\"188\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/v31Shw5/divider-red.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">合成配方可於此&nbsp; <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/AdditionalRedstone/wiki/Recipes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看</a> </span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/v31Shw5/divider-red.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">如果您對本模組有任何問題，或想了解即將推出的新功能：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">歡迎透過以下&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://discord.gg/bhUaWhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VQ66pHN/Discord.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\"> </a>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://discord.gg/bhUaWhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">連結</a> 加入我的 Discord。</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
